# Text files are stored and checked out with LF line endings on every OS. A CRLF would break the CLI's shebang
# (`node\r`) on macOS and Linux, and mixed endings make every edit look like a rewrite.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
